        <briefdescription>
<para>The node coordinates of a unit square or cube element, in the Abaqus node order: the corner nodes, then the midside nodes, each at <formula id="64">$(\xi + 1) / 2$</formula> of its natural coordinates. </para>
        </briefdescription>
